  {
   "text": "Brihat Jataka",
   "bbox": [
    1215,
    292,
    1506,
    329
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "218",
   "bbox": [
    290,
    294,
    385,
    330
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "(20), Vivaha Kala, (21) Graha karma.",
   "bbox": [
    290,
    396,
    1035,
    434
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "In this manner work in the three important branches of",
   "bbox": [
    365,
    475,
    1529,
    513
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "astrology we have composed works for the benefit of astrolo-",
   "bbox": [
    277,
    525,
    1509,
    565
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "gers.",
   "bbox": [
    288,
    585,
    391,
    619
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "<i>Notes:</i> Varahamihira gives the names of the chapters in his",
   "bbox": [
    365,
    657,
    1509,
    695
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "work on yatra. It is called Yatra Patala. He also refers to",
   "bbox": [
    287,
    708,
    1509,
    746
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Vivaha Patala which he composed.",
   "bbox": [
    290,
    761,
    984,
    800
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "पृथुविरचितमन्यै: शास्त्रमेतत्समस्तं",
   "bbox": [
    360,
    836,
    851,
    888
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "तदनु लघु मयेदं तत्प्रदेशार्थमेव।",
   "bbox": [
    360,
    902,
    819,
    954
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "कृतमिह हि समर्थे धीविषाणामलत्वे",
   "bbox": [
    358,
    965,
    880,
    1020
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "मम यदसदुक्तं सज्जनै: क्षम्यतां तत् ।। 7 ।।",
   "bbox": [
    359,
    1032,
    1016,
    1084
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Other great Rishis have written extensively on these sub-",
   "bbox": [
    364,
    1125,
    1508,
    1171
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "jects. I have given only a summary of their works. May the",
   "bbox": [
    286,
    1181,
    1507,
    1221
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "wise excuse my faults, if any, in my works. My purpose is only",
   "bbox": [
    288,
    1232,
    1508,
    1276
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "to sharpen and stimulate their intellact.",
   "bbox": [
    288,
    1285,
    1089,
    1324
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "ग्रन्थस्य यत्प्रचरतोऽस्य विनाशमेति",
   "bbox": [
    360,
    1363,
    853,
    1405
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "लेख्याद् बहुश्नुतमुखाधिगमक्रमेण।",
   "bbox": [
    358,
    1424,
    843,
    1480
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "यद्वा मया कुकृतमल्पमिहाकृतं वा",
   "bbox": [
    359,
    1492,
    845,
    1543
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "कार्यं तदत्र विदुषा परिहत्य रागम्।। 811",
   "bbox": [
    357,
    1557,
    951,
    1608
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "If the work suffers in any way, the reader must correct the",
   "bbox": [
    360,
    1653,
    1506,
    1692
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "errors after consulting the learned. I may have committed",
   "bbox": [
    284,
    1706,
    1505,
    1745
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "errors by negligence or misunderstanding the originals. The",
   "bbox": [
    284,
    1754,
    1505,
    1800
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "reader must correct them. I have no envy or mean jealousy.",
   "bbox": [
    284,
    1810,
    1483,
    1849
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "आदित्यदासतनयस्तदवाप्तबोध:",
   "bbox": [
    357,
    1884,
    803,
    1931
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "कापित्थके सवितृलब्धवरप्रसाद:।",
   "bbox": [
    357,
    1946,
    832,
    2001
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "आवन्तिको मुनिमतान्यवलोक्य सम्य-",
   "bbox": [
    357,
    2016,
    897,
    2067
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "ग्घोरां वराहमिहिरो रुचिराञ्चकार।। 9।।",
   "bbox": [
    357,
    2080,
    945,
    2130
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Varahamihira, the son of Adityadasa, was instructed by",
   "bbox": [
    360,
    2177,
    1505,
    2217
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "his father, The grace of the Sun gifted him wisdom. Born in",
   "bbox": [
    284,
    2230,
    1503,
    2270
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Kapitha in the region of Avanti, he carefully went through all",
   "bbox": [
    284,
    2282,
    1505,
    2322
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "the works of the earlier sages on this subject, and he composed",
   "bbox": [
    284,
    2335,
    1505,
    2375
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "this debetable work.",
   "bbox": [
    286,
    2387,
    691,
    2424
   ]
  }
 ]
}